# STIG CNTR-K8-000930: The Kubernetes Scheduler must enforce ports, protocols, and 
# STIG ID: V-242411 (MEDIUM)

META
    esp_id `k8s-cntr-k8-000930-sched-manifest-bind-001`
    version `1.0.0`
    dsl_schema_version `1.0.0`
    platform `kubernetes`
    criticality `high`

    title `STIG CNTR-K8-000930: The Kubernetes Scheduler must enforce ports, protocols, and services (PPS) that `
    description `The Kubernetes Scheduler must enforce ports, protocols, and services (PPS) that adhere to the Ports, Protocols, and Services Management Category Assurance List (PPSM CAL).`
    author `example-security`
    tags `kubernetes,stig,disa-stig`

    control_mapping `DISA-STIG:CNTR-K8-000930,NIST-800-53:CM-7`
    control_objective `CM-7`

    assessment_method `TEST`
    implementation_status `implemented`
    responsible_role `system-admin`

    control_origination `sp-system`
    inherited_from `Kubernetes:cluster:k8s-hardening`
    customer_responsibility `configuration`

    remediation_days `30`
    recommendation `Review and remediate per DISA STIG guidance for CNTR-K8-000930.`

    component_id `comp-k8s-cluster`

    impl_CM_7 `This control is validated by checking the required Kubernetes configuration against the DISA STIG baseline.`

META_END

DEF
    OBJECT target_file
        path `/etc/kubernetes/manifests/kube-scheduler.yaml`
    OBJECT_END

    STATE content_check
        content string contains `--bind-address`
    STATE_END

    CRI AND
        CTN file_content
            TEST all all AND
            STATE_REF content_check
            OBJECT_REF target_file
        CTN_END
    CRI_END
DEF_END
